sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Direct multipart bundle upload
  accDescr: The browser creates a session through the API, uploads parts directly to R2, asks the API to complete the upload, then polls while a runner processes the archive and saves the bundle.
  actor Browser
  participant API
  participant R2 as Cloud storage (R2)
  participant Runner as Processing runner
  participant DB as Database

  Browser->>API: Create upload session
  API->>R2: Start multipart upload
  R2-->>API: Upload ID
  API-->>Browser: Presigned part URLs

  par Up to 3 parts at a time
    Browser->>R2: PUT archive part
  and
    Browser->>R2: PUT archive part
  and
    Browser->>R2: PUT archive part
  end

  Browser->>API: Complete session with part ETags
  API->>R2: Complete multipart upload
  API->>R2: Verify final object size
  API->>DB: Queue processing
  API-->>Browser: Processing started

  Runner->>DB: Claim queued session
  Runner->>R2: Download archive
  Runner->>Runner: Validate, extract, and convert
  Runner->>DB: Save bundle and complete session

  loop Every second until complete
    Browser->>API: Get session status
    API->>DB: Read session
    API-->>Browser: Queued, processing, or bundle detail
  end
